{"headword":"חָפָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. cover (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, especially Pi.; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܦܳܐ</span> (especially Pa.); Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">خَفِىَ</span> <em>be hidden</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">خَفَى</span> <em>hide</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.30\">2 S 15:30</a> + 3 times; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.30\">2 S 15:30</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 6:12\" href=\"/Esther.6.12\">Est 6:12</a>;—<em>cover</em> the head <span dir=\"rtl\">(רֹאשׁ)</span>, in token of grief <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.30\">2 S 15:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.3\">Je 14:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.4\">4</a>; pt. agrees with <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.30\">2 S 15:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפוּי רֹאשׁ</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבֵל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Esther 6:12\" href=\"/Esther.6.12\">Est 6:12</a>; in token of sentence of death <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:8\" href=\"/Esther.7.8\">Est 7:8</a>."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pt. f. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶחְפָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:14\" href=\"/Psalms.68.14\">ψ 68:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כנפי יונה נ׳)</span>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> of material."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. (late) <span dir=\"rtl\">חִפָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.5\">2 Ch 3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.9\">9</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַף</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.7\">2 Ch 3:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַפֵּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:5\" hr